    body = charToRaw("[{\"url\":\"ghrepos/hypertidy/ncmeta/issues/33\",\"repository_url\":\"ghrepos/hypertidy/ncmeta\",\"labels_url\":\"ghrepos/hypertidy/ncmeta/issues/33/labels{/name}\",\"comments_url\":\"ghrepos/hypertidy/ncmeta/issues/33/comments\",\"events_url\":\"ghrepos/hypertidy/ncmeta/issues/33/events\",\"html_url\":\"https://github.com/hypertidy/ncmeta/pull/33\",\"id\":475954559,\"node_id\":\"MDExOlB1bGxSZXF1ZXN0MzAzNjA3ODM4\",\"number\":33,\"title\":\"a test and a bad fix for #32\",\"user\":{\"login\":\"dblodgett-usgs\",\"id\":1492803,\"node_id\":\"MDQ6VXNlcjE0OTI4MDM=\",\"avatar_url\":\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1492803?v=4\",\"gravatar_id\":\"\",\"url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/dblodgett-usgs\",\"html_url\":\"https://github.com/dblodgett-usgs\",\"followers_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/dblodgett-usgs/followers\",\"following_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/dblodgett-usgs/following{/other_user}\",\"gists_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/dblodgett-usgs/gists{/gist_id}\",\"starred_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/dblodgett-usgs/starred{/owner}{/repo}\",\"subscriptions_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/dblodgett-usgs/subscriptions\",\"organizations_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/dblodgett-usgs/orgs\",\"repos_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/dblodgett-usgs/repos\",\"events_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/dblodgett-usgs/events{/privacy}\",\"received_events_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/dblodgett-usgs/received_events\",\"type\":\"User\",\"user_view_type\":\"public\",\"site_admin\":false},\"labels\":[],\"state\":\"closed\",\"locked\":false,\"assignees\":[],\"milestone\":null,\"comments\":3,\"created_at\":\"2019-08-02T01:26:12Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2019-08-02T01:53:22Z\",\"closed_at\":\"2019-08-02T01:51:26Z\",\"assignee\":null,\"author_association\":\"CONTRIBUTOR\",\"issue_field_values\":[],\"type\":null,\"active_lock_reason\":null,\"draft\":false,\"pull_request\":{\"url\":\"ghrepos/hypertidy/ncmeta/pulls/33\",\"html_url\":\"https://github.com/hypertidy/ncmeta/pull/33\",\"diff_url\":\"https://github.com/hypertidy/ncmeta/pull/33.diff\",\"patch_url\":\"https://github.com/hypertidy/ncmeta/pull/33.patch\",\"merged_at\":\"2019-08-02T01:51:26Z\"},\"body\":\"I don't totally know what happened, but it looks like something with `RNetCDF` or `tibble` has changed pretty significantly. If you run the tests you'll see a bunch of errors around the `tibble::as_tibble(out)` calls because we are passing a list with different length elements to `as_tibble`. \",\"closed_by\":{\"login\":\"mdsumner\",\"id\":4107631,\"node_id\":\"MDQ6VXNlcjQxMDc2MzE=\",\"avatar_url\":\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4107631?v=4\",\"gravatar_id\":\"\",\"url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/mdsumner\",\"html_url\":\"https://github.com/mdsumner\",\"followers_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/mdsumner/followers\",\"following_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/mdsumner/following{/other_user}\",\"gists_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/mdsumner/gists{/gist_id}\",\"starred_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/mdsumner/starred{/owner}{/repo}\",\"subscriptions_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/mdsumner/subscriptions\",\"organizations_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/mdsumner/orgs\",\"repos_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/mdsumner/repos\",\"events_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/mdsumner/events{/privacy}\",\"received_events_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/mdsumner/received_events\",\"type\":\"User\",\"user_view_type\":\"public\",\"site_admin\":false},\"reactions\":{\"url\":\"ghrepos/hypertidy/ncmeta/issues/33/reactions\",\"total_count\":0,\"+1\":0,\"-1\":0,\"laugh\":0,\"hooray\":0,\"confused\":0,\"heart\":0,\"rocket\":0,\"eyes\":0},\"timeline_url\":\"ghrepos/hypertidy/ncmeta/issues/33/timeline\",\"performed_via_github_app\":null,\"state_reason\":null},{\"url\":\"ghrepos/hypertidy/ncmeta/issues/32\",\"repository_url\":\"ghrepos/hypertidy/ncmeta\",\"labels_url\":\"ghrepos/hypertidy/ncmeta/issues/32/labels{/name}\",\"comments_url\":\"ghrepos/hypertidy/ncmeta/issues/32/comments\",\"events_url\":\"ghrepos/hypertidy/ncmeta/issues/32/events\",\"html_url\":\"https://github.com/hypertidy/ncmeta/issues/32\",\"id\":475952406,\"node_id\":\"MDU6SXNzdWU0NzU5NTI0MDY=\",\"number\":32,\"title\":\"Issue with some nc4 files?\",\"user\":{\"login\":\"dblodgett-usgs\",\"id\":1492803,\"node_id\":\"MDQ6VXNlcjE0OTI4MDM=\",\"avatar_url\":\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1492803?v=4\",\"gravatar_id\":\"\",\"url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/dblodgett-usgs\",\"html_url\":\"https://github.com/dblodgett-usgs\",\"followers_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/dblodgett-usgs/followers\",\"following_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/dblodgett-usgs/following{/other_user}\",\"gists_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/dblodgett-usgs/gists{/gist_id}\",\"starred_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/dblodgett-usgs/starred{/owner}{/repo}\",\"subscriptions_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/dblodgett-usgs/subscriptions\",\"organizations_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/dblodgett-usgs/orgs\",\"repos_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/dblodgett-usgs/repos\",\"events_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/dblodgett-usgs/events{/privacy}\",\"received_events_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/dblodgett-usgs/received_events\",\"type\":\"User\",\"user_view_type\":\"public\",\"site_admin\":false},\"labels\":[],\"state\":\"closed\",\"locked\":false,\"assignees\":[],\"milestone\":null,\"comments\":2,\"created_at\":\"2019-08-02T01:14:27Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2020-04-29T11:59:24Z\",\"closed_at\":\"2020-04-29T11:59:24Z\",\"assignee\":null,\"author_association\":\"CONTRIBUTOR\",\"issue_field_values\":[],\"type\":null,\"active_lock_reason\":null,\"sub_issues_summary\":{\"total\":0,\"completed\":0,\"percent_completed\":0},\"issue_dependencies_summary\":{\"blocked_by\":0,\"total_blocked_by\":0,\"blocking\":0,\"total_blocking\":0},\"body\":\"I got a bug report from a user saying something wasn't working with a newly introduced NC4 version of some data that wasn't working previously. \\r\\n\\r\\nWas able to reproduce with:\\r\\n```\\r\\ndownload.file(\\\"https://www.northwestknowledge.net/metdata/data/pr_2019.nc\\\", 'pr_2019.nc')\\r\\nlibrary(ncmeta)\\r\\nnc_coord_vars <- nc_coord_var('pr_2019.nc')\\r\\nnc_gm_to_prj(nc_grid_mapping_atts('pr_2019.nc'))\\r\\n```\\r\\nTurns out that down in `nc_var` a list with an `integer(0)` was getting passed to `tibble::as_tibble()` and the length 0 element of the list causes as_tibble to return a 0 row tibble. \\r\\n\\r\\nStill debugging some things and will have a hacked up PR coming. I'm not sure what the _right_ way to solve this is going to be...\\r\\n\",\"closed_by\":{\"login\":\"dblodgett-usgs\",\"id\":1492803,\"node_id\":\"MDQ6VXNlcjE0OTI4MDM=\",\"avatar_url\":\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1492803?v=4\",\"gravatar_id\":\"\",\"url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/dblodgett-usgs\",\"html_url\":\"https://github.com/dblodgett-usgs\",\"followers_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/dblodgett-usgs/followers\",\"following_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/dblodgett-usgs/following{/other_user}\",\"gists_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/dblodgett-usgs/gists{/gist_id}\",\"starred_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/dblodgett-usgs/starred{/owner}{/repo}\",\"subscriptions_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/dblodgett-usgs/subscriptions\",\"organizations_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/dblodgett-usgs/orgs\",\"repos_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/dblodgett-usgs/repos\",\"events_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/dblodgett-usgs/events{/privacy}\",\"received_events_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/dblodgett-usgs/received_events\",\"type\":\"User\",\"user_view_type\":\"public\",\"site_admin\":false},\"reactions\":{\"url\":\"ghrepos/hypertidy/ncmeta/issues/32/reactions\",\"total_count\":0,\"+1\":0,\"-1\":0,\"laugh\":0,\"hooray\":0,\"confused\":0,\"heart\":0,\"rocket\":