riable value    \\r\\n   <chr>         <chr>    <list>   \\r\\n 1 standard_name lon      <chr [1]>\\r\\n 2 axis          lon      <chr [1]>\\r\\n 3 long_name     lon      <chr [1]>\\r\\n 4 units         lon      <chr [1]>\\r\\n 5 valid_min     lon      <dbl [1]>\\r\\n 6 valid_max     lon      <dbl [1]>\\r\\n 7 standard_name lat      <chr [1]>\\r\\n 8 axis          lat      <chr [1]>\\r\\n 9 long_name     lat      <chr [1]>\\r\\n10 units         lat      <chr [1]>\\r\\n# … with 114 more rows\\r\\n\\r\\n```\\r\\n\\r\\nIt should probably include the ID, but at least make sure that dummy NC_GLOBAL thing is consistent: \\r\\n\\r\\n```R\\r\\n> ncmeta::nc_atts(f[2])\\r\\n# A tibble: 124 x 4\\r\\n      id name          variable value    \\r\\n   <dbl> <chr>         <chr>    <list>   \\r\\n 1     0 standard_name lon      <chr [1]>\\r\\n 2     1 axis          lon      <chr [1]>\\r\\n 3     2 long_name     lon      <chr [1]>\\r\\n 4     3 units         lon      <chr [1]>\\r\\n 5     4 valid_min     lon      <dbl [1]>\\r\\n 6     5 valid_max     lon      <dbl [1]>\\r\\n 7     0 standard_name lat      <chr [1]>\\r\\n 8     1 axis          lat      <chr [1]>\\r\\n 9     2 long_name     lat      <chr [1]>\\r\\n10     3 units         lat      <chr [1]>\\r\\n# … with 114 more rows\\r\\n```\",\"closed_by\":{\"login\":\"mdsumner\",\"id\":4107631,\"node_id\":\"MDQ6VXNlcjQxMDc2MzE=\",\"avatar_url\":\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4107631?v=4\",\"gravatar_id\":\"\",\"url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/mdsumner\",\"html_url\":\"https://github.com/mdsumner\",\"followers_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/mdsumner/followers\",\"following_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/mdsumner/following{/other_user}\",\"gists_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/mdsumner/gists{/gist_id}\",\"starred_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/mdsumner/starred{/owner}{/repo}\",\"subscriptions_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/mdsumner/subscriptions\",\"organizations_url\":\"https://api.github.