\"node_id\":\"MDU6SXNzdWU0MDk2NjU2Njg=\",\"number\":26,\"title\":\"nc_grids is not normal form\",\"user\":{\"login\":\"mdsumner\",\"id\":4107631,\"node_id\":\"MDQ6VXNlcjQxMDc2MzE=\",\"avatar_url\":\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4107631?v=4\",\"gravatar_id\":\"\",\"url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/mdsumner\",\"html_url\":\"https://github.com/mdsumner\",\"followers_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/mdsumner/followers\",\"following_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/mdsumner/following{/other_user}\",\"gists_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/mdsumner/gists{/gist_id}\",\"starred_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/mdsumner/starred{/owner}{/repo}\",\"subscriptions_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/mdsumner/subscriptions\",\"organizations_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/mdsumner/orgs\",\"repos_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/mdsumner/repos\",\"events_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/mdsumner/events{/privacy}\",\"received_events_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/mdsumner/received_events\",\"type\":\"User\",\"user_view_type\":\"public\",\"site_admin\":false},\"labels\":[],\"state\":\"closed\",\"locked\":false,\"assignees\":[],\"milestone\":null,\"comments\":3,\"created_at\":\"2019-02-13T07:34:32Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2019-02-14T02:12:00Z\",\"closed_at\":\"2019-02-14T02:11:59Z\",\"assignee\":null,\"author_association\":\"MEMBER\",\"issue_field_values\":[],\"type\":null,\"active_lock_reason\":null,\"sub_issues_summary\":{\"total\":0,\"completed\":0,\"percent_completed\":0},\"issue_dependencies_summary\":{\"blocked_by\":0,\"total_blocked_by\":0,\"blocking\":0,\"total_blocking\":0},\"body\":\"_From @mdsumner on February 13, 2019 7:29_\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n`nc_grids` should have distinct grids, and `nc_vars` should list the grid it's in\\r\\n\\r\\n```R\\r\\nlibrary(dplyr)\\r\\nf <- system.file(\\\"extdata/argo\\\", package = \\\"tidync\\\") %>% list.files(full.names = TRUE)\\r\\ntidync::tidync(f)\\r\\nnc_vars(f) %>% distinct(name)\\r\\nnc_grids(f) %>% distinct(grid)\\r\\n\\r\\n```\\r\\n\\r\\nBoth should have `ndims`, nc_grids also nvars\\r\\n\\r\\n- [x] check this package\\r\\n- [x] check stars\\r\\n- [x] check tidync\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\nFollowing on from https://github.com/hypertidy/tidync/issues/77  pain, this will help the default variable or grid selection: \\r\\n\\r\\n- no NC_CHAR by default\\r\\n- pick the most dims\\r\\n- always in native order otherwise\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n_Copied from original issue: hypertidy/tidync#78_\",\"closed_by\":{\"login\":\"mdsumner\",\"id\":4107631,\"node_id\":\"MDQ6VXNlcjQxMDc2MzE=\",\"avatar_url\":\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4107631?v=4\",\"gravatar_id\":\"\",\"url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/mdsumner\",\"html_url\":\"https://github.com/mdsumner\",\"followers_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/mdsumner/followers\",\"following_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/mdsumner/following{/other_user}\",\"gists_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/mdsumner/gists{/gist_id}\",\"starred_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/mdsumner/starred{/owner}{/repo}\",\"subscriptions_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/mdsumner/subscriptions\",\"organizations_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/mdsumner/orgs\",\"repos_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/mdsumner/repos\",\"events_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/mdsumner/events{/privacy}\",\"received_events_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/mdsumner/received_events\",\"type\":\"User\",\"user_view_type\":\"public\",\"site_admin\":false},\"reactions\":{\"url\":\"ghrepos/hypertidy/ncmeta/issues/26/reactions\",\"total_count\":0,\"+1\":0,\"-1\":0,\"laugh\":0,\"hooray\":0,\"confused\":0,\"heart\":0,\"rocket\":0,\"eyes\":0},\"timeline_url\":\"ghrepos/hypertidy/ncmeta/issues/26/timeline\",\"performed_via_github_app\":null,\"state_reason\":\"completed\",\"pinned_comment\":null},{\"url\":\"ghrepos/hypertidy/ncmeta/issues/25\",\"repository_url\":\"ghrepos/hypertidy/ncmeta\",\"labels_url\":\"ghrepos/hypertidy/ncmet