    NA    time  NA    \\r\\n2 zlev     NA    NA    NA    NA    zlev  \\r\\n3 lat      NA    lat   NA    NA    NA    \\r\\n4 lon      lon   NA    NA    NA    NA    \\r\\n5 sst      lon   lat   NA    time  zlev  \\r\\n6 anom     lon   lat   NA    time  zlev  \\r\\n7 err      lon   lat   NA    time  zlev  \\r\\n8 ice      lon   lat   NA    time  zlev  \\r\\n```\",\"closed_by\":{\"login\":\"mdsumner\",\"id\":4107631,\"node_id\":\"MDQ6VXNlcjQxMDc2MzE=\",\"avatar_url\":\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4107631?v=4\",\"gravatar_id\":\"\",\"url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/mdsumner\",\"html_url\":\"https://github.com/mdsumner\",\"followers_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/mdsumner/followers\",\"following_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/mdsumner/following{/other_user}\",\"gists_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/mdsumner/gists{/gist_id}\",\"starred_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/mdsumner/starred{/owner}{/repo}\",\"subscriptions_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/mdsumner/subscriptions\",\"organizations_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/mdsumner/orgs\",\"repos_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/mdsumner/repos\",\"events_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/mdsumner/events{/privacy}\",\"received_events_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/mdsumner/received_events\",\"type\":\"User\",\"user_view_type\":\"public\",\"site_admin\":false},\"reactions\":{\"url\":\"ghrepos/hypertidy/ncmeta/issues/20/reactions\",\"total_count\":0,\"+1\":0,\"-1\":0,\"laugh\":0,\"hooray\":0,\"confused\":0,\"heart\":0,\"rocket\":0,\"eyes\":0},\"timeline_url\":\"ghrepos/hypertidy/ncmeta/issues/20/timeline\",\"performed_via_github_app\":null,\"state_reason\":null},{\"url\":\"ghrepos/hypertidy/ncmeta/issues/19\",\"repository_url\":\"ghrepos/hypertidy/ncmeta\",\"labels_url\":\"ghrepos/hypertidy/ncmeta/issues/19/labels{/name}\",\"comments_url\":\"ghrepos/hypertidy/ncmeta/issues/19/comments\",\"events_url\":\"ghrepos/hypertidy/ncmeta/issues/19/events\",\"html_url\":\"https://github.com/hypertidy/ncmeta/issues/19\",\"id\":397177656,\"node_id\":\"MDU6SXNzdWUzOTcxNzc2NTY=\",\"number\":19,\"title\":\"nc_coord_var divination\",\"user\":{\"login\":\"mdsumner\",\"id\":4107631,\"node_id\":\"MDQ6VXNlcjQxMDc2MzE=\",\"avatar_url\":\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4107631?v=4\",\"gravatar_id\":\"\",\"url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/mdsumner\",\"html_url\":\"https://github.com/mdsumner\",\"followers_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/mdsumner/followers\",\"following_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/mdsumner/following{/other_user}\",\"gists_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/mdsumner/gists{/gist_id}\",\"starred_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/mdsumner/starred{/owner}{/repo}\",\"subscriptions_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/mdsumner/subscriptions\",\"organizations_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/mdsumner/orgs\",\"repos_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/mdsumner/repos\",\"events_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/mdsumner/events{/privacy}\",\"received_events_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/mdsumner/received_events\",\"type\":\"User\",\"user_view_type\":\"public\",\"site_admin\":false},\"labels\":[],\"state\":\"closed\",\"locked\":false,\"assignees\":[],\"milestone\":null,\"comments\":7,\"created_at\":\"2019-01-09T01:54:17Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2019-01-09T17:27:21Z\",\"closed_at\":\"2019-01-09T03:22:11Z\",\"assignee\":null,\"author_association\":\"MEMBER\",\"issue_field_values\":[],\"type\":null,\"active_lock_reason\":null,\"sub_issues_summary\":{\"total\":0,\"completed\":0,\"percent_completed\":0},\"issue_dependencies_summary\":{\"blocked_by\":0,\"total_blocked_by\":0,\"blocking\":0,\"total_blocking\":0},\"body\":\"@dblodgett-usgs \\r\\n\\r\\nI have a question mark as I'm not sure if it's the reason, but I see a problem in the divining of XYZT at these lines https://github.com/hypertidy/ncmeta/blob/ce8ca204173bd5916b8c3a6b8e9be1d513baa464/R/nc_coord.R#L97-L102 \\r\\n\\r\\n```\\r\\n list(coord_var = names(coord_var),\\r\\n+      axis = unlist(coord_var))\\r\\n$coord_var\\r\\n[1] \\\"time\\\" \\\"zlev\\\" \\\"lat\\\"  \\\"lon\\\" \\r\\n\\r\\n$axis\\r\\ntime  lat  lon \\r\\n \\\"T\\\"  \\\"Y\\\"  \\\"X\\\" \\r\\n\\r\\n```\\r\\n\\r\\nzlev is missing\\r\\n\\r\\nI've attached a zipped file that shows the problem: \\r\\n\\r\\n```R\\r\\n nc_coord_var(\\\"avhrr-only-v2.19810901.nc\\\")\\r\\n Error: All columns in a tibble must be 1d or 2d objects:\\r\\n* Column `axis` is NULL\\r\\n\\r\\n```\\r\\n[avhrr-only-v2.19810901.nc.zip](https://github.com/hypertidy/ncmeta/files/2739046/avhrr-only-v2.19810901.nc.zip)\\r\\n\\r\\nNote that more recent files from OISST v2 don't exhibit this problem, presumably because they have a more standard form - these files exist in two versions, and reduced.nc was derived from this one - but must have become more sensible when it was created. \",\"closed_by\":{\"login\":\"mdsumner\",\"id\":4107631,\"node_id\":\"MDQ6VXNlcjQxMDc2MzE=\",\"avatar_url\":\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4107631?v=4\",\"gravatar_id\":\"\",\"url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/mdsumner\",\"html_url\":\"https://github.com/mdsumner\",\"followers_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/mdsumner/followers\",\"following_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/mdsumner/following{/other_user}\",\"gists_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/mdsumner/gists{/gist_id}\",\"starred_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/mdsumner/starred{/owner}{/repo}\",\"subscriptions_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/mdsumner/subscriptions\",\"organizations_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/mdsumner/orgs\",\"repos_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/mdsumner/repos\",\"events_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/mdsumner/events{/privacy}\",\"received_events_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/mdsumner/received_events\",\"type\":\"User\",\"user_view_type\":\"public\",\"site_admin\":false},\"reactions\":{\"url\":\"ghrepos/hypertidy/ncmeta/issues/19/reactions\",\"total_count\":0,\"+1\":0,\"-1\":0,\